<title>UK: British Columbia sets 1.5 bln French franc bond.</title>
<headline>British Columbia sets 1.5 bln French franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PROVINCE OF BRITISH COLUMBIA</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN FFR   COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    30.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.03    PAY DATE  L-30.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.5 BP   REOFFER    100.03    SPREAD	+20 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10-100-1M SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES	SPREAD OVER THE CURVE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
